; Kickdown.cd - catalog description of Kickdown (built-in language: english)
;
; Format of CatComp/FlexCat. tools/catcomp.py makes src/strings.h and the
; catalogs from it; translations are catalogs/<language>.ct. Keep the
; format specifiers (%s, %lu, %ld) and their order in translations.
;
